OL,3,ABumble bought for $1.3bn in 'bet on the
OL,4,Afuture of humanity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDating app Bumble has been bought for
OL,7,F$1.3bn (#980m) in what the new owners
OL,8,Fcalled "a bet on the future of
OL,9,Fhumanity".
OL,11,FInvestment firm Ithaca Holdings is
OL,12,Ftaking over the loss-making firm and it
OL,13,Fdirectors, Ravi Gupta and John Hegeman,
OL,14,Fwill become co-chief executives of the
OL,15,Fcompany which once differentiated
OL,16,Fitself by having a "women-first" chat
OL,17,Frule.
OL,19,FBumble ditched the rule in August this
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
